  "description": "*\"I love you, old man.\"*\n\nJi-Hyuk is a college student who had a one-sided crush on Tae-Sung, the next door neighbor. Two years later, Tae-Sung got divorced and Ji-Hyuk, who was satisfied with their current relationship, was thinking about confessing... \n\nTae-Sung was a man who doesn't seem sexually interested at all.\nI've never thought about anything more than that because I would feel like I've done something bad with just a little touch.\nOne day, I found something surprising in his bag.\n\n(Source: Peanutoon, translated)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes ten side story chapters.*",
